BT 1 0 0 1 0 102.5 Tm 2.759733 Tw 14 TL /F1 9.5 Tf .133333 .133333 .133333 rg (Agriculture is the primary livelihood for over 54% of India's population. Despite its foundational role, farmers) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.281167 Tw (constantly struggle with climate variability, soil nutrient depletion, unbalanced chemical fertilization, and volatile) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.811583 Tw (market prices. ) Tj /F2 9.5 Tf (AgriPredict AI) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( is an enterprise-grade agricultural analytics and predictive intelligence platform) Tj T* 0 Tw .8762 Tw (developed for the ) Tj /F2 9.5 Tf (Data Visualization Using Python \(DVP\)) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( course under the academic supervision of ) Tj /F2 9.5 Tf (Prof. Anita) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.041077 Tw (Thengade) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf (. Developed by ) Tj /F2 9.5 Tf (Anurag Kakad) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf (, ) Tj /F2 9.5 Tf (Shashwat Bakare) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf (, and ) Tj /F2 9.5 Tf (Bijin Binu) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf (, the platform synthesizes five) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.686375 Tw (real-world datasets: \(1\) 246,091 national crop production records \(1997\2262015\), \(2\) 771,456 hourly weather) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.447929 Tw (observations across 8 cities \(2009\2262020\), \(3\) 620 laboratory soil chemistry samples, \(4\) 99 chemical fertilizer) Tj T* 0 Tw (recommendations, and \(5\) 122 APMC Mandi commodity market prices.) Tj T* ET
